{
 "id": "seg1",
 "title": "九个验证者",
 "pill": 1,
 "total": 62.82,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2022 年 3 月 23 日，Ronin 跨链桥被提走约 17.36 万枚 ETH，和约 2550 万枚 USDC。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 3 月 23 日，Ronin 跨链桥被提走约 17.36 万枚 ETH，和约 2550 万枚 USDC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 10.32,
   "speechStart": 1.703,
   "speechEnd": 11.756
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "只用了两笔交易。",
   "spoken": "只用了两笔交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 12.14,
   "dur": 1.92,
   "speechStart": 12.14,
   "speechEnd": 13.853
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "这座桥有 9 个验证者。",
   "spoken": "这座桥有 9 个验证者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 14.28,
   "dur": 2.08,
   "speechStart": 14.377,
   "speechEnd": 16.13
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "一笔提款，只要其中 5 个签名，就会放行。",
   "spoken": "一笔提款，只要其中 5 个签名，就会放行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 16.58,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 16.673,
   "speechEnd": 20.016
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "听上去，要攻破过半数的人。",
   "spoken": "听上去，要攻破过半数的人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 20.4,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 20.4,
   "speechEnd": 23.308
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 23.74,
   "dur": 1.04,
   "speechStart": 23.74,
   "speechEnd": 24.541
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "9 个验证者里，有 4 个由同一家公司 Sky Mavis 运营。",
   "spoken": "9 个验证者里，有 4 个由同一家公司 Sky Mavis 运营。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 25.0,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 25.0,
   "speechEnd": 29.156
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "第 5 个签名，可以通过 Axie DAO 的一项授权拿到。这项授权，本应早就撤销。",
   "spoken": "第 5 个签名，可以通过 Axie DAO 的一项授权拿到。这项授权，本应早就撤销。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 29.54,
   "dur": 7.28,
   "speechStart": 29.54,
   "speechEnd": 36.628
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "攻击者最少要攻破几个组织？",
   "spoken": "攻击者最少要攻破几个组织？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 37.04,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 37.04,
   "speechEnd": 39.767
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "答案是两个。",
   "spoken": "答案是两个。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 40.5,
   "dur": 1.6,
   "speechStart": 40.594,
   "speechEnd": 41.921
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "门限写的是 9 个里要 5 个，独立的防线却只有两道。",
   "spoken": "门限写的是 9 个里要 5 个，独立的防线却只有两道。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg1-10.wav",
   "start": 42.32,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 42.411,
   "speechEnd": 47.988
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "按 Ronin 复盘和 Elliptic 的分析，攻击者控制了这 5 个验证者的签名。",
   "spoken": "按 Ronin 复盘和 Elliptic 的分析，攻击者控制了这 5 个验证者的签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg1-11.wav",
   "start": 48.46,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 48.553,
   "speechEnd": 54.07
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-12",
   "text": "公开报道的损失，约 6.2 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "公开报道的损失，约 6.2 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg1-12.wav",
   "start": 54.52,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 54.52,
   "speechEnd": 57.719
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-13",
   "text": "一座桥，凭什么相信另一条链上发生的事？",
   "spoken": "一座桥，凭什么相信另一条链上发生的事？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg1-13.wav",
   "start": 58.18,
